            "CONSIDERED rather than the ones that produced argv would print 'relocated 1' on the "
            "one platform whose entire point is that its no-op be distinguishable, which is the "
            "thing the count exists to prevent",
            (lambda out: "need no load-path rewrite" in out and "relocated" not in out)(
